  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Apple grew to about five times its starting value, and Microsoft to almost four times. Nintendo nearly doubled, as did the US share basket. Bonds gained only a little. The five years included a pandemic and large changes in interest rates, none of which made prices move in a straight line.",
