  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "People watched interest rates, climate talks, new games and an approaching spacecraft flyby. Technology companies reported their results.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "A broad basket and individual companies had different outcomes. Even strong gains over five years included periods when prices fell.",
    "what_faded_away": "A holiday hit or one strong quarter could not settle the next five years. Good company news did not remove the risk of its shares.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "The pandemic was unknown. It is easier to explain the eventual winners after seeing the chart than to choose them beforehand.",
